"you  ········································ ai\n     0%           untracked 100%            0%\n\nNo authorship was recorded for this commit, so added lines are shown as untracked.\n\nLikely cause: agent/editor hooks or the git proxy did not checkpoint before this commit.\n\nTo diagnose and start capturing authorship:\n  autter install-hooks    # wire up agent and editor hooks\n  autter install          # ensure git proxy + trace2 are configured\n  autter doctor           # verify checkpoint → attribution round-trip\n  autter daemon restart    # if doctor says checkpoints are not persisting\n  autter debug            # full support dump if doctor still fails\n"
